<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes secondary participation.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes secondary participation.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the single repurchase agreement whereby it had sought to drain 204 million pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The repurchase agreement was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    204 million    1 day    18.20 pct</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
